launches for the morning GTD walk[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]PRE and POST checklist rows walk in a deliberate, configured order [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]of named stages (terminal → periods → browser → everything else in [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]PRE; periods → Morning review in POST) that every review surface [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]shows the same way, and three recurring PRE rows remind Bryan, on [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]each period-review day, to launch the agents that draft last [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]week's, quarter's, and year's period-note Reviews.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]gtd_checklist_stages.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/gtd_checklist_stages.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-ho[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ho/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Checklist stages in the bob-cli evaluator, CLI, and contract[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]walk_order[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]walk_order: parse and validate freshness.pre_stages/post_stages, resolve[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]each PRE/POST row's stage, sort PRE/POST by stage rank then path and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]line, add three lints, schema-16 JSON, the human stage detail, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared CS/SC fixture, and the freshness contract and guide docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Relative period ids (last-week, last-quarter, last-year) in [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]bob periods[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]period_ids[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]period_ids: accept last-week, last-quarter, and last-year wherever bob [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]periods show, brief, and draft take a PERIOD, resolved against today, so[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the launch rows can carry one paste-ready agent prompt forever.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Checklist stages in bob-ledger-tools (JS mirror, namespace [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]v14, footer)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]ledger_order[dim] · [dim][/dim]after walk_order[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ledger_order: mirror the stage config, resolver, and comparator in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]JS evaluator against a byte-for-byte copy of the shared fixture, expose [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stage fields under freshness namespace v14 checklistStages, and show the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stage in the review footer and landing toasts.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stage labels beside the sunrise and flag in the editor[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]stage_labels[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ledger_order[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stage_labels: specify and render a quiet small-caps stage label right [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]after the PRE sunrise / POST flag in Live Preview and Reading view, only[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for a configured stage tag adjacent to the identity run, with tooltip, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reveal, toggle, and light/dark checks.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stage-end ticks and staged-advance regression tests in [/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]navigation[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]nav_ticks[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ledger_order[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]nav_ticks: add the quiet STAGE ✓ tick to Ctrl+Enter done lines when a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stage's last due row is completed, and lock in queue-order advance when [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the next staged row sits above the cursor.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Config, vault rows, end-to-end verification, and the decision [bold black on #87D7FF][/bold #D7AFFF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]record[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after walk_order, period_ids, ledger_order, stage_labels, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]nav_ticks[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rollout: add the stage lists to the chezmoi-managed bob config, tag the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]existing gtd_daily rows, add the three launch rows, reword the review [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rows, verify the Monday walk, and write the accepted memory records.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-ho","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-ho.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-69780162e33f12da67dacf43fbad6b23","started_at":"2026-11-05T23:49:51.940678+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"4074ce34c0ab03364ea90eb153e1270b8f463064f8b2d7bf329a32e5941d09ee","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ho.land--plan/chat.md","size_bytes":13125},"commits":{"digest":"e54b64da844185f12c68d68480029d0d078ddfe28b97d59d35c5c01439ded41e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ho.land--plan/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ho.land--plan/embedded